{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようまりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/27/1328755/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はお昼に父とご飯食べに行き、\nその後はれいか、ちはる、ちま\nメンバーのお母さまたちと\n会って夜ご飯食べましたーうへーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/27/1328755/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急に誘われたもんで、\n顔が薄い状態で行きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/27/1328755/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目がとろんとろんしてる笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"駅の中を30分もさまよってて\n電話でれいかに道を\n教えてもらいながら行った。\n方向音痴。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3人で迎えに来てくれて感動した笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この方向音痴アホが\n迷惑かけてごめんよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/27/1328755/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は小中の仲良しメンツと\n久々に会ってくる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーいわーいわーい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/27/1328755/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/27/1328755/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"金曜日にUTBさんの\nソログラビアの撮影をしました。\n私にとって初の個人のお仕事。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このような機会をいただけるなんて\n本当に、本当に、有難き幸せ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月23日発売です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}